## Quick Revision
* Sequential Flow: Node 1 -> Node 2 -> ... -> Node N without branching.
* Node Contract: def node_name(state: StateType) -> StateType:
* Graph Entry & Exit: START and END imported from langgraph.graph.
* Execution Trigger: workflow.invoke(initial_state).
* Model Invocation Output: Always extract .content from model.invoke().
* Prompt Chaining Pattern: Output of Step N updates the state and feeds into the prompt of Step N+1.
* LangGraph vs. Chains: LangGraph preserves intermediate outputs across all nodes in the final state dictionary.

